00:03:19.071 --> 00:03:22.169
which I decided to go back to post GSB.

00:03:22.169 --> 00:03:26.415
But throughout I've also had
business experiences and

00:03:26.415 --> 00:03:30.217
consulting, did my
internship at Bain company.

00:03:30.217 --> 00:03:36.296
And also currently am the president
